# nonav.mscr - "do nothing" target for the Navigation button (MortScript 4.1).
# Used while navigation was fully disabled: instead of starting the crashing
# navigon.exe, it just brings the SEAT menu back to the front.
# To use it, point NgAppCom.xml to .\..\nonav.exe instead of .\..\abrenav.exe.
ErrorLevel("off")
Show("VwUserShell")
Exit
